# Local development secrets. Wrangler and @cloudflare/vite-plugin load this
# file automatically for `npm run dev` and `npm run preview`; `wrangler deploy`
# never uploads it.
#
# This value is committed on purpose. It is a throwaway HMAC key for a demo app
# whose data is per-session and disposable, and hardcoding it keeps `npm run dev`
# and the Playwright suite zero-config for anyone cloning the repo.
#
# Production gets a real one, set out of band and never stored in the repo:
#   wrangler secret put AUTH_SECRET
AUTH_SECRET="dev-only-insecure-secret-do-not-use-in-production"
